      "writtenOn": "2014-11-19T01:12:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it is absolute. It\u0027s fine if it contain spaces. getPath() unescapes the URL and returns just the part of the path. Given that this URI came from a file, we can ignore the rest. The reason I convert it to a URL is to remove windows backslashes and normalize it to forward slashes which is how everything else is represented in the updater.",
